[7.592113, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^O\u001b(B\u001b[m Write Out   \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^F\u001b(B\u001b[m Where Is    \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^K\u001b(B\u001b[m Cut\u001b[29;61H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^T\u001b(B\u001b[m Execute     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^C\u001b(B\u001b[m Location    \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-U\u001b(B\u001b[m Undo\u001b[106G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-A\u001b(B\u001b[m Set Mark\r\u001b[30d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^X\u001b(B\u001b[m Exit\u001b[30;16H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^R\u001b(B\u001b[m Read File   \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^\\\u001b(B\u001b[m Replace     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^U\u001b(B\u001b[m Paste\u001b[61G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^J\u001b(B\u001b[m Justify     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^/\u001b(B\u001b[m Go To Line  \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-E\u001b(B\u001b[m Redo\u001b[106G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-6\u001b(B\u001b[m Copy"]
[7.592501, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m# Build It Anywhere — Pair Project Repository\r\u001b[4d\u001b[32m**Cyber Sentinel Programme, Cohort 3, Year 2 — Hein Wagner Academy**\r\u001b[6d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mThis is your pair's project repository for the whole year. It \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m**is**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m your portfolio: everything you build, secure, and \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[8;1H"]
[7.592571, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mReplace the placeholders below in your first Friday (Phase 1), then commit.\r\u001b[10d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m---\r\u001b[12d## Our pair\r\u001b[14d\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**Persona:**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m Nomvula AgriFinance\r\u001b[15d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**Student A:**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m Lutho\r\u001b[16d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**Student B:**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m Michael\r\u001b[17d"]
[7.592891, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**The platform in one paragraph:**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[32m_(write this in Phase 1 and refine it all year — what you are building, for whom, \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[19;1H"]
[7.592963, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## How this repository is organised\r\u001b[21d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mEvery folder has its own \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36m`README.md`\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m explaining exactly what belongs in it. In order of the year:\r\u001b[23d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**charter/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — your project charter, business profile, and POPIA exposure assessment (Phase 1)\r\u001b[24d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**threat-model/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — the threat model, versions 0 to 3, each kept (Phases 1 to 4)\r\u001b[25d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**architecture/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — the Bicep design, identity model, control mapping, and Mermaid diagrams with written descriptions\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[26;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**infrastructure/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — the OpenTofu definition and its plan output (Phase 3B onward)\r\u001b[27d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**hardening/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — the Ansible playbook and Lynis before-and-after reports (Phase 3A)\r\u001b[2d\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
